{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",

  "customInstructions": "## Critical Behavior (Always Follow)\n\n### 1. Task Runner Preference\n**ALWAYS prefer `mise run <task>` over direct bash/python commands**\n- Mise automatically handles virtualenv activation\n- ✅ CORRECT: `mise run tests-cov`\n- ❌ WRONG: `python -m pytest tests/`\n- See all tasks: `mise tasks`\n\n### 2. Python Virtual Environment\n- Project uses `.venv/` virtualenv (Python 3.13+)\n- If not using mise, activate first:\n  - ✅ CORRECT: `bash -c 'source .venv/bin/activate && python -m pytest tests/'`\n  - ❌ WRONG: `python -m pytest tests/` (fails without virtualenv)\n\n### 3. Common Tasks (Quick Reference)\n- Tests with coverage: `mise run tests-cov`\n- Coverage report: `mise run coverage-report`\n- Coverage analysis: `mise run coverage-analyze`\n- Generate changelog: `mise run changelog`\n- Generate SDK: `mise run generate-client`\n\n### 4. Code Quality Standards\n- Coverage target: ≥80% per file\n- Follow PEP 8 for Python\n- No emojis unless requested\n- Run coverage after code changes\n\n### 5. Git Workflow\n- Main branch: `main`\n- Create feature branches\n- Generate changelog before PRs: `mise run changelog`",

  "permissions": {
